<subpara id="RM0000008Y400WX_02" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00002PP00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The resistance of the thermistor built into the E.F.I. water temperature sensor changes according to changes in the water temperature. The E.F.I. water temperature sensor is connected to the engine control computer in the same way as the intake air temperature sensor.</ptxt>
